  "details": "Right now, disabling gestures freezes the gesture left/right parameters but there's no way to detect if they are frozen. I think it would be useful to have that as a parameter.\n\nI'm not asking to stop freezing them and using this new parameter to manually do it instead because it will break every single existing avatar, but... I'm not saying it wouldn't be cool to be able to choose that behaviour too. Non-Index users would benefit from that (keeping hand gestures with no expressions for example).",
